{
  "$comment": [
    "The Gearbox 1.2 ABI surface, frozen. NOT a copy of abi.json -- only the",
    "three things a COMPILED mod depends on: the import name, its wire",
    "signature, and the capability that gates it. Docs and parameter names may",
    "be reworded freely; those cannot break a .wasm that already exists.",
    "",
    "Written when 1.3 added Neural.Decide: the mod_ai_choose hook and the",
    "action_valid mask it needs, which let a mod choose the AI's move instead",
    "of only watching it. Everything listed here existed before that and must",
    "keep working: within major version 1 a symbol may be added but never",
    "renamed, re-signed, or re-gated."
  ],
